To add a clickable timeline that shows the evolution of textile machinery during the Industrial Revolution, you can use JavaScript and HTML. Here's an example code:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Textile Machinery during the Industrial Revolution</title>
    <style>
        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .timeline::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 6px;
            background-color: #f1f1f1;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 50%;
            margin-left: -3px;
        }
        .container {
